# audiotest: the UI headless. Nothing is played here: the system sounds of ui.beep and of the
# dialog only print "sound: NAME" in a headless run, and `expect sound` checks what was asked
# for (the script language: docs/GUIDE.md section 12; the sounds: section 33).
size 720 1000
expect "Abspielen" exists
expect "Glocke (WAV)" exists
expect text:"Aus" exists
# a dialog that plays the warning sound when it opens (Windows and Linux desktops do)
click "Warnung im Dialog"
expect dialog:"Achtung" exists
expect sound warning
wait 100
expect sound none
click "OK"
expect dialog:"Achtung" missing
# the system's sounds through ui.beep
click "Information"
expect sound information
click "Benachrichtigung"
expect sound notify
# the app's switch: no sound any more, neither from buttons nor from the dialog
click "Klänge an"
expect "Klänge an" unchecked
click "Fehler"
expect sound none
click "Warnung im Dialog"
expect dialog:"Achtung" exists
expect sound none
click "OK"
click "Klänge an"
click "Frage"
expect sound question
shot build/audiotest.png
